OL,3,GNEWSAFestival in memory of son to mark
OL,4,A10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA music festival in memory of a man who
OL,7,Ftook his own life is set to mark 10
OL,8,Fyears of the event, with organisers
OL,9,Fhoping it will encourage more young
OL,10,Fpeople to seek mental health support.
OL,12,FWillfest 26 is named after Will Garvey,
OL,13,Ffrom West Hallam in Derbyshire, who was
OL,14,Fstudying at the University of Leeds
OL,15,Fwhen he died. His parents said they had
OL,16,Fnoticed their son becoming more
OL,17,Fwithdrawn but were unaware of the
OL,18,Fextent of his struggle with anxiety and
OL,19,Fdepression.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
