OL,3,GNEWSAFestival in memory of son to mark
OL,4,A10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing his death, the family began
OL,7,Fhosting annual memorial concerts in
OL,8,Ftheir garden, which grew into a
OL,9,Ffull-scale festival.
OL,11,FHis mother, Joanna, said: "We have
OL,12,Fcreated an atmosphere Will would have
OL,13,Fenjoyed and approved of."
